<title>USA: Lincoln Health, Ill., repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Lincoln Health, Ill., repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it repriced $27.3 million Illinois Health Facilities Authority bonds, for Sarah Bush Lincoln Health Center, raising yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2022 unchanged at 6.20 percent.</p>
</text>
